ion\n----------------------------------------\nsnapshot_at | 2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00 | 固定基准时点，不读取系统当前时间\nbusiness_timezone | Asia/Shanghai | 中国业务时间；UTC+08:00\ndaily_brief_hour | 08:00 | 统计上一个完整自然日，异常存量截至前一日23:59:59\norder_completion_basis | 全量签收 | 分批发货、部分签收均不算订单完成\nrisk_red_threshold | 0.65 | 演示概率>=0.65红\nrisk_yellow_threshold | 0.3 | 0.30<=演示概率<0.65黄，其余绿\nnode_red_grace_hours | 0 | 计划结束已到但未完成的节点标红\nexception_event_grace_hours | 4 | 额外超过4小时创建节点异常事件\nrisk_min_samples | 5 | 不足时回退样本池，条件尾部不足时标记外推\nrisk_simulation_trials | 512 | 固定随机种子，拉普拉斯平滑；不是经真实数据校准的概率\ntrend_ma_window | 7 | 工作中心用有作业日，企业实物产量用自然日\ntrend_slope_window | 14 | 线性回归斜率\ntrend_decline_threshold | -0.1 | 移动平均环比跌幅超过10%且斜率<0\ncurrency | CNY | 人民币口径\nopening_inventory | 0 | 各批次期初库存为0；各批次先入后出\nmock_seed | 20260918 | 确定性生成，不代表客户真实经营情况\nproduction_calendar | 周一至周六 | 演示工作日历，不套用真实法定节假日\nerp_poll_seconds | 60 | 仅Mock配置，无真实连接\nsource_lookup_key | sales_order_id/work_order_id | 合同编号不保证唯一；禁止仅用合同编号跨表JOIN\nsource_risk_usage | 仅保留原始标记 | 不可当作实际延期标签或预测答案\n(20 rows)", "id": "877d8020250d48279011f358d2d6bf97", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:48:20.491748", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:48:20.492788", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_787cedb82afb4ab8bcc49b62", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "workcenter_name | days | ah | esh | eff_all\n----------------------------------------\n加工二组 | 249 | 12641.977 | 11951.1089 | 0.9454\n装配二组 | 237 | 5900.9934 | 5745.4062 | 0.9736\n装配一组 | 235 | 5410.0037 | 5281.2376 | 0.9762\n加工一组 | 248 | 11324.7257 | 11055.848 | 0.9763\n(4 rows)", "id": "c37a22ed3d5b45cba957728db56410a7", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:48:20.507994", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:48:20.508920", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Now compute daily 人效 per workcenter on workdays, take last 14 workdays (points), compute 7-point MA of rece